  "player_text": "I ignore the stew seller. I face the guard holding the line and say it again: I am not asking him. What do I need to show or pay to pass this gate?",
  "visible_motivation": "I left the runner and spoke to a guard, but the reply came from the tavern runner and stopped after one sentence. I address the guard directly.",
  "intended_meaning": "Ask the gate guard, not the runner, what is required to pass.",
